
- API information:
    - CreateRoom:
        - User -> Room state, Player role, [Player ID which is always 0].
        - Others -> N/A.
    - JoinRoom:
        - User -> Room state, Player role, [Player ID].
        - Others -> Room state, Player role, [Player ID], [Player name].
    - TakeTurn:
        - User -> Room state.
        - Others -> Player ID, Turn, Room state.

    - "Room state" means:
        - Room ID.
        - List of player names.
        - Game state.
    - [Brackets] mean the information is redundant but convenient.

